cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Axium in academic or research work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Axium: An AI-Native Visual Knowledge Atlas"
abstract: >
  Axium is an AI-powered interactive atlas of human knowledge. It transforms
  any topic into an explorable knowledge graph, generated on demand by a
  large language model against a strict hierarchical schema, rather than
  presenting information as articles, search results, or chat responses.
authors:
